"ha" = (/obj/structure/sign/custom/plaque{name = "Airfield"; desc = "Click a hangar console for a fuelled light plane. Taxi to the north holding point, turn onto the runway facing south, open the throttle to the top gear and roll: the plane climbs after eight tiles. Fly through the sky gates in order for a timed lap. To land, slow to gear 2 or lower, line up over the runway and Descend."},/turf/floor/plating/concrete,/area/caribbean/barracks/annex/airfield)
